<div class="page-header"><div class="page-header-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Trust and safety</span><h1>Privacy</h1><p>How this institution uses academic and account information within EduFlow.</p></div></div>
<div class="row g-3"><div class="col-lg-8"><section class="card section-card"><div class="section-title-row"><div><h2>Role-limited access</h2><p>Information is available only where your account role and permissions allow it.</p></div><span class="metric-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></span></div><div class="activity-list"><div class="activity-item"><span class="activity-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i></span><span class="activity-copy"><strong>Protected academic records</strong><small>Student, attendance and marks data is checked on the server before access.</small></span></div><div class="activity-item"><span class="activity-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left"></i></span><span class="activity-copy"><strong>Important actions are logged</strong><small>Administrative changes may be recorded for accountability and security.</small></span></div><div class="activity-item"><span class="activity-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-key"></i></span><span class="activity-copy"><strong>Passwords stay private</strong><small>Passwords are processed through secure Identity hashing and are never shown in the interface.</small></span></div></div></section></div></div>
